.el .ds Aq '
.TH xyrev 1  "xyrev 0.2.3" 
.SH NAME
xyrev \- A helpful utility designed to make xyrev effortless.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBxyrev\fR [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR]... [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
A helpful utility designed to make xyrev effortless.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Use verbose output (\-vv very verbose/build.rs output)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
xyrev\-init(1)
Create a new configuration folder or reinitialize the existing one
.TP
xyrev\-dotfile(1)
.SH VERSION
v0.2.3
